  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "If you've been waiting for an affordable opportunity to secure your place in Takapuna, this could be it.\r\n\r\nAnd don't let the Esmonde Road address put you off coming to the open home - there's plenty of off-street parking, so simply pull in, park and come through for a look.\r\n\r\nPositioned at the front of a small block, this beautifully presented two-bedroom home combines the reassurance of brick and tile construction with a surprisingly spacious, modern interior and superb outdoor living.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you'll immediately appreciate the polished timber floors and light-filled living area. The modern kitchen features stone benchtops, quality appliances and soft-close cabinetry, while the updated bathroom completes a home where the hard work has already been done.\r\n\r\nComfort hasn't been overlooked either, with double-glazed aluminium joinery helping make this an easy home to enjoy throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nOne of the real highlights is the generous living area opening directly onto a large, sunny and private deck - an ideal spot for summer entertaining, morning coffee or simply relaxing at the end of the day. The easy-care grounds mean you can enjoy the outdoor space without spending your weekends maintaining it.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location.\r\n\r\nFrom here you're within easy reach of Takapuna Beach, shops, cafés, restaurants and public transport, while access to the motorway and CBD is exceptionally convenient.\r\n\r\nWith two off-street car parks, two genuine double bedrooms and a location that continues to be one of the North Shore's most sought-after, this is an excellent option for first-home buyers, downsizers, professionals or those wanting a Takapuna lock-up-and-leave.\r\n\r\nWhy you'll want to see it:\r\n* Two double bedrooms\r\n* Modern kitchen with stone benchtops\r\n* Updated bathroom\r\n* Polished timber flooring\r\n* Double-glazed aluminium joinery\r\n* Low-maintenance brick and tile construction\r\n* Sunny, private outdoor entertaining area\r\n* Easy-care grounds\r\n* Two off-street car parks\r\n* Excellent access to Takapuna, the motorway and CBD\r\n\r\nTakapuna at this price deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nCome along to the open home or contact me to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nOPEN HOME PARKING IS EASY - there's plenty of off-street parking, so just pull in, park and come have a look\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that this information has been sourced from third parties. View our property information disclaimer here: raineandhorne.co.nz/property-disclaimer",
